{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_03",
  "title": "自由射手",
  "storyCode": "LE-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7f4b15a832673344542094940e67aeff777df21e8f183fc4683caed3b5789b32",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g1_gorgeousstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我看看......没错，就是这家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么豪华，真的是乐器店吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，这是全维谢海姆最好的乐器商店，要不然我也不会带你来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我来高庭区根本没申请......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那帮官僚效率低得很，等他们看到你的申请，音乐会都结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说，就算被发现了，不也就是罚款么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说，要是有人协助感染者离开夕照区，对这个人的处罚比对感染者本人更重......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怕什么，没关系的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把腰挺直了，别畏缩，要是被看出来也很麻烦的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生您好，请问您是要挑选乐器，还是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，我们来选购一把大提琴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知这位先生是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他？他是我的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，虽然失礼，但我得提醒您，衣着不整的人是禁止入店的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我还是在外面等着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在外面？您这样鬼鬼祟祟，到底在害怕什么？您——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道自己在怀疑谁吗？衣着不整、鬼鬼祟祟......竟敢这样形容一位贵族，是不是不想在这儿干下去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他现在只是一时困窘，不得已穿得朴素些，衣着既无脏污又无缺损，你凭什么不让他入店？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请恕我失言，可这位先生的穿着，与本店的整体格调......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格调？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这位——堂兄弟，刚刚遭了很大的变故，视若珍宝的大提琴也在动荡中遭到破坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我正想带他来买把新琴，略表慰问之意，哪轮得到你来妄谈什么格调？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我对此感到十分痛心，但衣着不整之人禁止入内，这也是我们的规定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很抱歉，我不能让您的这位同伴入店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑键把自己的斗篷脱了下来，直接披在白垩身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在他和我穿了一样的衣服，他能不能进？还是说，我这件斗篷也算衣着不整的一部分？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我一会儿再穿上这件斗篷，是不是连我都不能进了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我去问下店长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个看人下菜碟的家伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的外套，给你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别客气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从一开始就是我答应要给你买琴，也是我把你拉过来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算跟那个人打一架，我也得把你带进这家店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "万分抱歉，本店向两位致以诚挚的歉意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "资历尚浅的店员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "店长马上就来，他将亲自为两位介绍本店的乐器......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，请问您现在有时间吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是芙蓉呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关于您的病情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g1_gorgeousstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真怕刚才那个店员突然报告治安官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会呢，他又不知道你是感染者，只不过看你穿得穷酸，把你当成一般的平民——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧啧，我们忘了一样东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘了东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "演出服啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可不能穿这一身上台演出，太不正式了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，我给你找全维谢海姆最好的裁缝——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，量体型的时候，源石结晶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这倒也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就——找夕照区最好的裁缝，怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g7_concerthall_outside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天空湛蓝晴朗......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还是要谢谢你，谢谢你给我买这把琴，谢谢你帮我订做衣服！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大提琴也就算了，衣服还没拿到手呢，也不知道你穿起来是什么样的，不用忙着谢我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明天下午就知道了！一定会很合身的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从乐器店出来开始，你除了哼歌就是道谢，已经谢了我十几次啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "河水潺潺流淌......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这曲子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像听过，又好像没听过......没什么，可能是我弄错了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，既然你学过大提琴，为什么自己没有琴呢？坏了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教我大提琴的老师确实送过我一把琴，但很快就被人弄坏了，虽然现在还放在家里，但恐怕......离开这座城市的时候，只能带着琴弓走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "琴弓？只留着琴弓，能有什么用？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要看到琴弓，我就能想起老师的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是连琴弓也没了，我怕我会把老师忘掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘掉？可你现在不是好好记着吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实已经开始忘了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老师是个头发很长的萨科塔大姐姐，穿的衣服很素净，嘴上总是有笑意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以前能记住更多的，仿佛老师就站在我的眼前......现在不行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实我曾经想记住很多人的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我需要一些纪念，保证我不会忘光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......纪念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那这次呢？你打算拿什么纪念车尔尼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请他给我签个名就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛的芙蓉呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉的话，或许可以找她要一个带罗德岛标志的空药瓶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗，这也太随便了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要能让我想起来就好，形式不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我呢？就是这把大提琴了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是别吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老师送我的大提琴很快就坏了，假如这一把也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想留一枚你送我的硬币，钻个孔，做个小小的挂坠，应该挺不错的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "纪念我的怎么是钱啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，不行吗？那我换一个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用、不用，也挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们现在就回家练习？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我想......我们先去车尔尼先生家一趟吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "免了，他一看见我就来气，我又不是不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是误会而已，会解开的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从我们第一天遇见他，你就在说我和他有误会了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算真有误会，我觉得也已经解不开了，还是算了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天车尔尼先生不也认可过你了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "误会都是一点一点解开的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，我也想找车尔尼先生试试你给我买的琴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么好的琴，如果没有懂行的听众，那也太可惜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，请问您有时间吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迟疑的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉？不好意思，我不是很有空......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您只需要回答几个问题就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果其中有您不愿意回答的，您也可以选择不回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迟疑的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不抽我的血？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没得到您的允许，我是不会那么做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迟疑的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g5_czernyhome"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我个人不是很想承认，但这样的琴可不是你们一上午就能在夕照区淘到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们去高庭区了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胆子不小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实......为了让我进店，黑键还和乐器店的店员吵了一架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吵架？他还嫌你这身衣服在高庭区不够显眼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个店员说是“衣着不整不得入店”，可白垩这身衣服哪里不整了？他们无非是看白垩一身平民的衣服，故意找茬罢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一个贵族，倒开始为平民打抱不平了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是为白垩打抱不平！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不论到底是贵族还是平民，他的水平完全配得上那家店里的乐器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不让白垩进店，反而把精品卖给那些空有花架子的贵族，简直就是把上好的木料当柴火烧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难为你能说出这样的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白垩，你去熟悉一下新琴吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我给黑键伴奏，让他单独练一会儿，看看能不能改一改他的习惯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "改一改我的习惯......这个，我还是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题，车尔尼先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）你看，误会是会一点一点解除的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）车尔尼先生的态度已经在转变了，现在就看你啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蛮横的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魔族佬？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蛮横的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赶紧滚，你还没长记性吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，打扰您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蛮横的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你给我回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您还有事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蛮横的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你肯定又想回你那办事处躲着去吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咖啡店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么做多少有点过火了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蛮横的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你算哪根葱——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咖啡店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可还欠着我不少咖啡钱呢，你觉得我算哪根葱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蛮横的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，原来是别格勒店长......不好意思，我刚刚没注意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夕照区毕竟是感染者聚居区，虽然很有活力，可蛮不讲理的人也不少，你最好还是小心一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢您的提醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我的名片，上面有我咖啡店的电话，想喝了可以打给我，我们的外送服务很快的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，罗德岛办事处之前不一直是行板在打理吗，你是刚调派到这里来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我其实是来调查这里的异常现象的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，别格勒先生，您的病情——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "异常现象？什么异常现象，我完全不知道啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是这样的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "状况如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的贵族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉赫曼的行动很成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的贵族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乌提卡伯爵大体按照预期行动，虽然对拉赫曼造成了一定的妨碍，但他应该是无心的，也没引发什么后果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这没什么。我本来也不指望靠一个拉赫曼就把罗德岛的人赶出夕照区。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的贵族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于车尔尼，为了请那些眼高于顶的评论家出席音乐会，他几乎把以前的人情全用了，还搭了不少版权进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的贵族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有消息说，他捏着鼻子，给自己以前很看不起的一个贵族的曲集写了推荐文章......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对他而言，做到这种程度，已经不可能回头了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前几天那个萨科塔呢？我记得她入城申报的时候说自己是从拉特兰来莱塔尼亚采风的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的贵族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照记录，她已经结束了在维谢海姆的游览，在今天早些时候离开了维谢海姆，前往下一个目的地了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那她的事就不用管了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，我们该去夕照厅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的贵族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我们和车尔尼约的时间是晚上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "准备工作还很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，万一那个人一时兴起去夕照厅闲逛，我们布置的人可拦不住他，到时候就麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
